{"abstract":"To support the Small Business Administration's (\"SBA\" or \"Agency\") commitment to expanding access to capital for eligible small businesses in underserved markets and to refine and improve the Community Advantage (\"CA\") Pilot Program, the purpose of which is increasing 7(a) loans to small business in underserved markets, SBA is issuing this notice to extend the term of the CA Pilot Program through September 30, 2024, and to remove the temporary moratorium on the SBA's acceptance of new Community Advantage Lender Participation Applications (\"CA Lender Applications\").","action":"Notice; request for comments.","agencies":[{"id":468,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/468","name":"Small Business Administration","parent_id":null,"raw_name":"SMALL BUSINESS ADMINISTRATION","slug":"small-business-administration","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/small-business-administration"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2022/04/01/2022-06919.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"87 FR 19165","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"The changes identified in this notice take effect April 1, 2022. SBA will begin accepting new CA Lender Participation Applications May 2, 2022. The CA Pilot Program will remain in effect until September 30, 2024.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["Docket No. SBA-2022-0002"],"dockets":[],"document_number":"2022-06919","effective_on":"2022-04-01","end_page":19166,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"full_text_xml_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/xml/2022/04/01/2022-06919.xml","html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2022/04/01/2022-06919/community-advantage-pilot-program","images":{},"images_metadata":{},"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/documents/2022-06919?publication_date=2022-04-01","mods_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/metadata/granule/FR-2022-04-01/2022-06919/mods.xml","not_received_for_publication":null,"page_length":2,"page_views":{"count":1235,"last_updated":"2026-10-23 08:15:04 -0400"},"pdf_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2022-04-01/pdf/2022-06919.pdf","presidential_document_number":null,"proclamation_number":null,"public_inspection_pdf_url":"https://public-inspection.federalregister.gov/2022-06919.pdf?1648730731","publication_date":"2022-04-01","raw_text_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2022/04/01/2022-06919.txt","regulation_id_number_info":{},"regulation_id_numbers":[],"regulations_dot_gov_info":{"checked_regulationsdotgov_at":"2022-04-01T10:26:53Z"},"regulations_dot_gov_url":null,"significant":null,"signing_date":null,"start_page":19165,"subtype":null,"title":"Community Advantage Pilot Program","toc_doc":"Community Advantage Pilot Program","toc_subject":null,"topics":[],"type":"Notice","volume":87}